The [[Fanfare]] is a godly [[Accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. Occasionally it randomly either gains an {{icon/empower}}, gains some {{icon/mana}} and removes some {{icon/mana}} from the opponent, or removes a stamina from the opponent. It triggers faster for each item in a cone-like zone in front of it, up to a maximum of 90% faster.

It's best to have a use for {{icon/mana}} to get the most out of the overall effect.

The [[Fanfare]] is one of the few {{icon/musical}}-items in the game that synergizes with the [[Adventurer]] [[Ukulele]] subclass item.

[[Engineer]]s can combine the [[Fanfare]] with a [[Charge Splitter]] to create the [[Stuff-Throwinator]], which is a very unique weapon.
